{
    "_comment": [
        "CANONICAL RSC cross-layer contract fixture. Consumed by:",
        "  PHP  tests/Unit/Rsc/RscContractTest.php (reactive-1 app suite)",
        "  Rust readyset-util/src/reverb_http.rs #[cfg(test)] (vendored copy at readyset-businesspress/fixtures/)",
        "  JS   packages/businesspress/core/resources/js/rsc/auth-hash.test.mjs (node --test)",
        "Identity formula (authoritative: RscGraphQLCache::getAuthContext + core-channels.php rsc.{authHash}):",
        "  authHash = md5(user_id . \":\" . (shop_id ?? \"none\") . \":\" . scope), scope defaults to \"customer\"; anonymous = literal \"anon\".",
        "Regenerate ONLY via the generator script and re-vendor the Rust copy (check-rsc-contract-sync.sh)."
    ],
    "hash_inputs": [
        {
            "user_id": "42",
            "shop_id": null,
            "scope": null,
            "expected_auth_hash": "f5ee91cb8f066325d7e66be95fcd0503",
            "note": "user without shop, default scope -> md5(\"42:none:customer\") \u2014 the null-shop \"none\" case"
        },
        {
            "user_id": "42",
            "shop_id": "7",
            "scope": null,
            "expected_auth_hash": "faf0aaf988d0a32dadc93dd8c3e9adc7",
            "note": "user with shop, default scope -> md5(\"42:7:customer\")"
        },
        {
            "user_id": "42",
            "shop_id": "7",
            "scope": "vendor",
            "expected_auth_hash": "c051110f9ca8a9dece4a658cafe0a3ab",
            "note": "explicit non-default scope"
        },
        {
            "user_id": "0198a111-2222-7333-8444-555566667777",
            "shop_id": "0198b111-2222-7333-8444-555566667778",
            "scope": "admin",
            "expected_auth_hash": "809b679826b8d01e6a7a564194e11274",
            "note": "uuid ids, admin scope"
        },
        {
            "user_id": "42",
            "shop_id": null,
            "scope": "vendor",
            "expected_auth_hash": "33d686da81a5607ac0dc78fc07ac84c0",
            "note": "no shop + explicit scope"
        },
        {
            "user_id": null,
            "shop_id": null,
            "scope": null,
            "expected_auth_hash": "anon",
            "note": "unauthenticated -> literal \"anon\", never hashed"
        }
    ],
